WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:02,320
Xia Yiqing, are you serious?

2
00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:12,070
We didn't even have a chance to land the second blow.

3
00:00:12,510 --> 00:00:26,810
How did Xia Yiqing attack and retreat?

4
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:28,660
I don't want to kill you

5
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:42,790
This machine has high resistance

6
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:45,990
But this kind of crushing is not calculated at all.

7
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:46,950
let's go

8
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:49,500
Stop fighting and don't come back again

9
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:51,300
The leader is a good man

10
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:53,780
He won't take action unless he takes the initiative to attack here.

11
00:00:54,140 --> 00:00:55,740
If you do it again, you will die.
